  "description": "TRAIL MARSHALL – Vintage Western Display Font\nCommand the frontier with Trail Marshall, a rugged vintage slab serif font engineered for time-honored western heritage! Featuring sharp bracketed serifs, tall condensed proportions, and authentic weathered wood-grain textures, this commanding typeface evokes the rugged spirit of old cattle companies, marshal badges, and historic wilderness trailheads. Its bold, chiseled structure brings powerful authenticity to every letterform.\nIdeal for western cattle company branding, ranch signage, leather goods packaging, craft distillery labels, rodeo banners, outdoor apparel, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>TRAIL MARSHALL – Vintage Western Display Font</p>\n<p>Command the frontier with Trail Marshall, a rugged vintage slab serif font engineered for time-honored western heritage! Featuring sharp bracketed serifs, tall condensed proportions, and authentic weathered wood-grain textures, this commanding typeface evokes the rugged spirit of old cattle companies, marshal badges, and historic wilderness trailheads. Its bold, chiseled structure brings powerful authenticity to every letterform.</p>\n<p>Ideal for western cattle company branding, ranch signage, leather goods packaging, craft distillery labels, rodeo banners, outdoor apparel, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!</p>",
